The season that comes after autumn is winter.

Here is the PHP function `getMaxOccurrence` as requested:

```php
<?php

function getMaxOccurrence(array $numbers): int {
    if (empty($numbers)) {
        return 0; // Or throw an exception, depending on requirements
    }

    $counts = array_count_values($numbers);

    // Find the maximum occurrence count
    $maxCount = max($counts);

    // Filter numbers that have the maximum occurrence count
    $candidates = array_keys(array_filter($counts, function($count) use ($maxCount) {
        return $count === $maxCount;
    }));

    // Return the smallest number among the candidates
    return min($candidates);
}
```
